--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- V18__seed_firm5_john_link_whitelabel.sql
--
-- Cross-host silent-SSO demo fixture for firm 5 (CreativeOne / c1wealth).
--
-- Seeds advisor login user 'john' in firm 5 and wires the two facts the
-- "open the firm-5 whitelabel host in another tab" scenario needs:
--
--   1. john is the SAME PERSON as firm-1 'tim1' — LINKED_GW_USER points at
--      tim1's firm-1 entity (the person), exactly what the GWAdmin link/delink
--      screen writes and what PersonRegistry follows. So when tim1 (already
--      authenticated, with a live Keycloak SSO session) lands on the firm-5
--      whitelabel host, OidcCallbackAction.switchToFirmAccount resolves the
--      person's firm-5 account → john, and the session is established AS john.
--
--   2. john.localhost resolves to firm 5 — SYSTEM_BASE_URL='john.localhost' is
--      an advisor-level whitelabel base URL, so AuthorizationManagerTrait
--      .IdentifyFirmByUrlMsg matches the host to firm 5 (CP_WHITELABEL_KEYWORD
--      'jhn' is the brand keyword). `*.localhost` resolves to 127.0.0.1 with no
--      /etc/hosts entry, so this is a usable dev host out of the box.
--
-- The login user mirrors the V17 firm-5 advisor row shape (ENTITY_TYPE 4,
-- active, not inactivated) so getActiveUsers lists it; no password hash (john
-- enters via the SSO firm-switch, never a credential form), no role/access set
-- (capability grants are a separate concern, cf. V14). The shared primary email
-- tim1@geowealth.int matches tim1's, keeping the "same person" story coherent
-- (the link itself is explicit via LINKED_GW_USER, not email-derived here).
--
-- Requires : V2 (firm 1 + tim1 — the link target) and V8 (firm 5 config).
-- Idempotent: INSERTs are NOT EXISTS-guarded and the trailing UPDATE re-asserts
-- the link/whitelabel, so a hand-created john (dev box) is corrected in place.
-- Also drives the e2e/tests/p1-login-newtab-john.spec.ts scenario 1:1.
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

